From 19b332b997dfba935bb3cbd700e9513f1e942da0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini experiment <experiment@invalid>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:30:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt6797: bound ordinary data TX owners by PID

Default to one owner. Permit four ordinary data owners in the measurement
profile, each with an exact PID and unchanged 750 ms status bound. Preserve
TC1 page reconciliation, management and reserved ownership, descriptors
and firmware commands. Credit shortfall and a busy next PID wait without
consuming an owner. Cleanup waits for all data owners and both ledgers.

Internal experiment archive; synthetic non-certifying author,
not submission-ready.
